WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.090
I am fluent in Fraggle.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.509
I took, like, 4 years of Fraggle in high school.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:13.138
I'm very new to the Fraggle language, so, I'll go with it.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.222
You ready for a quiz then?

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:15.348
Where do I sign up?

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.391
Go ahead. Sure.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.184
I don't have a lot of Fraggles to practice with

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.978
so who knows how much I remember.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.062
Did you say games?

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.731
I'm in!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.232
What is a 'merggle'?

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:28.278
I'm going to assume it's something to do with music?

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.113
That is the

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:31.531
slide where the...you know...

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:34.451
Well everyone knows that a 'merggle' is

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:37.037
a special kind of satchel

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.955
and you carry around your

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:41.082
Doozer sticks in a merggle

00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:42.876
so you can snack on them later.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.213
Right? I don't know.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.548
I don't know what a 'merggle' is.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.009
Oh, they're a race of aquatic Fraggles

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.052
who live among the roots

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.762
and limbs of the Great Tree.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.637
Oh!

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:55.722
Yeah. There you go.

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:58.266
What are 'stinkleberries'?

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:01.186
Um...I have no idea.

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:02.812
It's pretty self explanatory.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:05.065
Stinkleberries are considered a delicacy.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.608
They're terrible for you. Rot your teeth.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:07.984
They're tiny. They're like...

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:10.320
Some Fraggles make preserves out of them.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.279
I don't get it.

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.530
Yeah, I don't. [all murmuring]

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.200
Stinkleberries are a berry fruit

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.619
that typically grow near the trash heap.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:18.620
They smell awful,

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.705
and can be used to un-freeze a Fraggle.

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:21.289
There it is.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.833
It's pretty much what I said.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.001
No I don't think so.

00:01:25.001 --> 00:01:26.669
Yeah. I had that completely wrong.

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:30.465
Who's ready?

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:32.717
What is a 'baloobius'?

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:33.885
'Baloobius'?

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:34.844
Uh...

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:35.845
Uh...

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:37.764
Is it something to do with light?

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.932
It's glowing!

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.433
Is it like the end of a tail?

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:41.935
Come on, tail. Do something!

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:43.019
Yes!

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:44.312
The Baloobius is the fringe

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:46.064
on the end of a Fraggle's tail.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:48.525
It tends to flare out when the Fraggle is scared

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:51.194
and can even glow when a Fraggle feels truly

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:52.362
at peace with oneself.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:53.029
See! Light!

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:54.405
Oh, yeah. Ah, that's right. 

00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:56.157
Whoa it's like a party on your tail!

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:58.326
Are you kidding me! Of course!

00:01:58.493 --> 00:01:59.661
Down in Fraggle Rock!

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:01.830
Down in Fraggle Rock!

